(Startup Funding Proposal) Tj
T*
(Rosendal Equestrian Experiences \(REE\)) Tj
T*
(Rosendal, Free State, South Africa) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Date: May 26, 2026) Tj
T*
(Purpose: Secure startup funding for a small, practical tourism activity business.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1\) Executive Summary) Tj
T*
(REE is a small startup focused on guided horse experiences for weekend visitors in Rosendal.) Tj
T*
(The strategy is intentionally conservative: start small, control costs, prove demand, and grow) Tj
T*
(only after stable monthly performance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This proposal is designed for investors who want:) Tj
T*
(Modest initial capital requirements) Tj
T*
(Clear risk controls) Tj
T*
(Realistic pricing aligned to South African activity market ranges) Tj
T*
(Transparent milestones before scaling) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2\) Why This Can Work in Rosendal) Tj
T*
(Rosendal is a small town, so the business model is built around visitor demand, not local) Tj
T*
(resident volume.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The model fits towns like Rosendal because:) Tj
T*
(Visitors already come for a quiet countryside experience) Tj
T*
(Accommodation operators need activity partners) Tj
T*
(Horse experiences are memorable, visual, and suitable for families/couples) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3\) Startup Scope \(Keep It Small\)) Tj
T*
(Phase 1 \(first 6 months\)) Tj
T*
(Launch with only 3 core products:) Tj
T*
(Scenic Ride \(60 minutes\)) Tj
T*
(Sunset Ride \(75?90 minutes\)) Tj
T*
(Kids Pony Ride \(10?15 minutes\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Operating days: Friday to Sunday + public holidays) Tj
T*
(Approach: Low fixed costs, pre-booking preferred, strict weather/safety controls) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4\) Pricing \(Recent & Reasonable\)) Tj
T*
(Pricing is benchmarked to recent publicly listed South African trail/pony offers \(2025?2026\),) Tj
T*
(where 1-hour trail rides often fall around R350?R750 and pony options are lower.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Recommended launch pricing \(Rosendal startup level\)) Tj
T*
(Kids Pony Ride \(10?15 min\): R120?R180) Tj
T*
(Scenic Ride \(60 min\): R380?R520 per person) Tj
T*
(Sunset Ride \(75?90 min\): R550?R750 per person) Tj
ET
endstream
