(10\) Risk & Mitigation \(Realistic\)) Tj
T*
(Low-demand weekends) Tj
T*
(   Mitigation: Flexible staffing, partner bundles, seasonal offers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Bad weather disruptions) Tj
T*
(   Mitigation: Clear reschedule terms and weather buffers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Safety incidents) Tj
T*
(   Mitigation: SOPs, training, conservative rider matching, insurance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Cashflow pressure early months) Tj
T*
(   Mitigation: Lean cost base, strict cash tracking, phased spending.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
