T*
(Months 1?2) Tj
T*
(Finalize compliance, forms, and SOPs) Tj
T*
(Confirm first accommodation partners) Tj
T*
(Soft launch limited slots) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Months 3?6) Tj
T*
(Stabilize weekend operations) Tj
T*
(Track demand by product and partner) Tj
T*
(Adjust pricing only after data) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Months 7?12) Tj
T*
(Improve occupancy and repeat bookings) Tj
T*
(Add one premium add-on only if margins support it) Tj
T*
(Prepare small expansion case for year 2) Tj
